ST ..> CH : overlay
ST ..> IND
BT ..> CH
BT ..> IND

MD --> CoreVo
TR --> CoreVo
ST --> CoreVo
BT --> CoreVo
MD --> CoreContracts
TR --> CoreContracts
ST --> CoreContracts
