ST ..> SurfTrading
ST ..> SurfDev
MD ..> SurfDev : system controls · picker
IND ..> SurfDev : script checklist
TR ..> SurfSettings : settings_section
MD ..> SurfSettings : settings_section
MD ..> Cli : cli_command
TR ..> Cli
ST ..> Cli

